<title>USA: Blue-chip stocks end firmer.</title>
<headline>Blue-chip stocks end firmer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue-chip stocks closed slightly firmer Friday, as the market digested more than a dozen initial public offerings and investors braced for a spate of economic reports next week.</p>
<p>Based on early and unofficial data, the Dow Jones industrial average ended up 4.07 points at 5,872.92.</p>
<p>In the broader market, advancing issues led declines 12-10 on active volume of about 407 million shares on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
